safeshell (1.5.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release: undo names the snapshot and asks first, never
    overwrites newer work, keeps pipes, hard links, times and owners;
    snapshot size and free-space checks with pruning; snapshots without
    the sandbox; scripts that ask for root are not run unattended; the
    English assistant uses project context and follow-ups; downloads are
    capped at their pinned size.

